               <title>Inactive ingredients</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>butyl paraben, carboxymethylcellulose sodium, cellulose, citric acid, D&amp;C red # 33, FD&amp;C blue # 1, flavors, glycerin, high fructose corn syrup, propylene glycol, purified water, sodium benzoate, sorbitol, sucralose, xanthan gum</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20160926"/>
            </section>
         </component>
